            "raw_text": "COMMERCIAL LEASE AGREEMENT\nThis Commercial Lease Agreement is entered into as of February 1, 2023, between Lodo Office Properties LP (\"Landlord\") and Alpine IT Solutions LLC (\"Tenant\").\n1. Premises\nLandlord leases to Tenant the premises at 1740 Broadway, Suite 420, Denver, Colorado 80202, consisting of approximately 2,800 square feet of Class B office space.\n2. Term\nInitial Term: February 1, 2023 through January 31, 2028 (5 years).\nRenewal Option: Tenant has one (1) option to renew for two (2) additional years at 102% of then-current market rent, exercisable 120 days prior to expiration.\n3. Rent\n4. Use\nPremises shall be used exclusively for IT consulting, managed services delivery, light lab work, and related administrative functions. No server colocation for third-party clients without landlord consent.\n5. Assignment\nTenant may assign this Lease in connection with a bona fide sale of the Tenant's business upon 30 days written notice to Landlord. Landlord consent is required but shall not be unreasonably withheld.\n6. Equipment\nTenant is permitted to install and operate server, networking, and UPS equipment consistent with the Premises' electrical capacity. Tenant shall not exceed 20 amps of continuous electrical load without Landlord's prior written consent.\nSigned:\nLandlord: _________________________     Date: _____________\nTenant (Alpine IT Solutions LLC): _________________________     Date: _____________\nMember/Owner: Kyle Hartigan     Date: _____________",
